        "feedback": "Not quite. Water molecules respond to the waves, but adding water isn’t the way to even out this casserole."
      },
      {
        "text": "Take it out as soon as the edges feel warm.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "feedback": "The center can still be cool. Heat takes time to spread, so stirring and standing help."
